@title A hint on a window's title bar says a double click maximises it, and restores it (Preferences, 1920x1080)
@area Windows
@sizes 1920x1080
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text File #1
wait 5
click_text Preferences
wait 20
move 800 269
wait 60
shot hint-maximise
double_click 960 269
wait 20
move 700 33
wait 5
move 960 33
wait 60
shot hint-restore
check_layout
